# @SHLIBS@ covers linked libraries; qt6-wayland is the Wayland platform
# plugin, which Qt loads at runtime and no library link pulls in.
Package: catberry-ac
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: CatDesuFR <stefan.zara.tudor@gmail.com>
Depends: catberry, @SHLIBS@, qt6-wayland
Homepage: https://github.com/CatDesuFR/catberry/tree/ac
Description: catberry autoclicker: clicks or presses a key at a set rate
 Open it from the app menu, or run: catberry ac gui
